OL,5,G1030 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe final visit takes the B&Bers
OL,7,     Fto 18 Craigmillar Park in
OL,8,     FEdinburgh. The guests are
OL,9,     Fimpressed by host Craig's military
OL,10,     Fprecision, but their feedback
OL,11,     Fleaves him in quite a huff!
OL,12,G1105 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's payment day and the B&Bers
OL,14,     Fmeet to discuss dirty remarks and
OL,15,     Ffilthy findings. After their
OL,16,     Fdifferences are aired and
OL,17,     Fdiscrepancies debated, the winner
OL,18,     Fis announced.
